Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:41.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（鲍里斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.24,0:00:57.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（探访证）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.84,0:05:33.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（月桂冠监狱）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.54,0:06:03.75,Title,0,0,0,0,,《黑衣人3》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.72,0:08:23.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（悼念Z 19XX-2012）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.22,0:11:37.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（吴园酒家 钻石花园海鲜饭店）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.86,0:14:45.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（背面：停止营业）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.44,0:31:32.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（清仓大处理）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.60,0:36:56.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（华尔街崩盘 新一轮金融危机蒸发亿万资金 1929年10月）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.32,0:37:00.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（战争结束了 1945年8月）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.04,0:38:03.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（人类即将首次登月 1969年7月16日）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.59,0:38:46.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（登月是人类的梦想 阿姆斯特朗准备好了）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.42,0:38:50.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（罗斯福饭店）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.56,0:40:30.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（康尼岛）
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.39,0:50:51.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（宇宙保龄球馆）
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.76,1:15:09.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（纽约邮政 今日登月）
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.59,1:20:31.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（禁区）
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.91,1:29:25.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1969年7月16日 9点30分）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.92,0:01:14.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（扫描结果 陶瓷炊具占6% 有机物质占94%可通行）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.89,0:01:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧啊 居然有人来看鲍里斯这个孽畜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, Boris the Animal has a visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.89,0:01:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,40年来 这是头一回{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess one every 40 years is okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.33,0:01:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是个蛋糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.73,0:01:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么我说了算{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I decide what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.17,0:01:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来就是个蛋糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like some kind of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是干净的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.80,0:01:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是那个意思 你懂的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not clean, but you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.88,0:01:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.52,0:02:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,孽畜鲍里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boris the Animal,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.02,0:02:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人看你来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've got a visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.79,0:02:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我鲍里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just Boris.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.97,0:02:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的来信 一直都是我的心灵鸡汤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your letters have been a soul-nourishing tonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.61,0:02:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可比照片要来得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.81,0:02:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,骨骼清秀 英俊脱俗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}unconventionally handsome than your photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.36,0:02:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是配偶探访{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't a conjugal visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.29,0:02:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还是停止交配行为吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So quit your conjugating.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.93,0:02:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上次交配是什么时候的事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When's the last time you conjugated anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.57,0:02:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我看到你给我带礼物了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you've brought me a treat, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.24,0:02:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,能帮忙切一下吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you mind cutting this up for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.68,0:02:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是个特殊的日子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a special day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.44,0:03:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是这么浪漫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a romantic like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.01,0:03:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好别这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.65,0:03:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.48,0:03:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,会毁了你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll ruin your figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.20,0:03:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你令我完整{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You complete me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.32,0:04:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,大的那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍里斯 你答应过要带我一起走的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boris! You promised to take me with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.89,0:04:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说好了的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.33,0:04:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄巴底亚·普莱斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obadiah Price.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.53,0:04:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我的确答应过你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I did make you a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.75,0:04:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 有点不对劲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. I smell something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.82,0:04:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,束手就擒吧 鲍里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't win, Boris.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.49,0:04:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不这么想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's agree to disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:04:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们人多势众{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's too many of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.43,0:05:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿真热 开个天窗怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rather hot in here. Mind if I open a window?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.78,0:05:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不住了 亲爱的 谢谢你的蛋糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, darling. We did love the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.67,0:05:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,K 我们来重写历史吧 怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's rewrite history, shall we, K?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.06,0:06:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,下午好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.20,0:06:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家注意 我的同事探员J有话要说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please give your attention to my associate, Agent J.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.07,0:06:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将给你们示范一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going to demonstrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用电生理零突触机制的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}an electro-biomechanical neural-transmitting,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.96,0:06:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,神经传导复位器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}zero-synapse repositioner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.70,0:06:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们称之为神经分析仪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We call it the neuralyzer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.34,0:06:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 速战速决 小子 - 多谢提醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep it simple, slick. - Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.58,0:06:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 探员K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Agent K.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.78,0:06:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 请看这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, if you will look right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.08,0:06:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家知道 在飞机上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how you're on an airplane.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.36,0:06:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,乘务员会请你把手机关掉 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a flight attendant asks you to turn your cellphone off?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.99,0:06:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定会说 我才不关呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're like, "I ain't turning my cellphone off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.72,0:06:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,手机又不会影响该死的飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That don't have nothing to do with no damn plane."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.39,0:06:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果就这样了 后果很严重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is what we get. That's what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.96,0:06:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机出轨 扰乱卫星 接着就相撞了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gets up there, bounces around on the satellites and… bang!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.36,0:06:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以说还是乖乖地把手机关了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's that just turn your damn phone off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.93,0:06:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上开车小心点 你们会冲下悬崖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're gonna drive off a cliff tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.16,0:06:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了卫星 全球定位系统就没用了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because your GPS don't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.60,0:06:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查一下燃料成分和表层沉积物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the composition of the fuel units and surface deposits.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.61,0:06:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要知道是谁的飞行器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna know who was driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.18,0:06:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.74,0:06:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你今晚准备如何致辞 - 别担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you gonna say tonight? - Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.11,0:06:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我可担心了 这很重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm very worried. This is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.11,0:07:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我饿了 你呢 - K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm hungry. You hungry? - K.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.98,0:07:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 我看那压根就不是肉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, I'm not even sure that's meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.82,0:07:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面好像有颗牙齿 也许是爪子或者脚趾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I just saw a tooth in that thing. Or a claw. Or a hoof.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.32,0:07:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 曼尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Manny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.99,0:07:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮塔饼里不该有那玩意儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That does not belong in a pita,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.24,0:07:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,放在棺材里还差不多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it belongs in a casket.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.69,0:07:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是安安静静的 该多好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what would go good with this would be silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题就在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, here's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.40,0:07:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闻不出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't smell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.73,0:07:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你久在鲍鱼之肆不闻其臭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because your nose already smells like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.54,0:07:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我 出淤泥而不染{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but my nose doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.26,0:07:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,沉默是金 雄辩是银{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silence goes good with a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.82,0:07:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尝试过沉默吗 还是你不说话就会死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever try or is talking the way you breathe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.21,0:07:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是讨厌我 直说就是了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you hate me, just say you hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.83,0:07:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拿车子出气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't take it out on the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.01,0:07:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我享受一下美味吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me enjoy this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.58,0:07:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,还享受呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, enjoyment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.35,0:07:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来你享受的时候 表情是这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's what enjoyment looks like on that face.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.00,0:07:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自我陶醉的样子 我喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like that emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.92,0:07:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不自我陶醉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep emotion out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.65,0:07:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 K 为了「正常」生活吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of what, K? Life?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.16,0:07:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚真不打算让我代言吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't wanna run it by me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.76,0:07:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟我说说你要讲什么吧 - 别担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me know what you'll say? - Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.86,0:07:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我很担心 非常担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, I'm worried. Very worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.46,0:07:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是悼词啊 你得表现出感情来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the man's eulogy. You have to show some feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.47,0:07:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是正常人利用面部的变化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that thing that human people do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.92,0:07:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,来反应情感的行为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when they change the expression on their face?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.50,0:07:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和Z共事了40年 他是个牛逼的探员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worked with Zed for 40 years. A hell of an agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.01,0:08:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也为他定制了一个牛逼的悼词{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have written a hell of a speech for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.11,0:08:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,会很感人的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People will be moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.17,0:08:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 由K来致辞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now a few words from Agent K.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.03,0:08:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和Z共事了40多年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worked with Zed for over 40 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.07,0:08:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他从没请我吃过饭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in all that time he never invited me to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.04,0:08:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没邀请我去他家里看比赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never asked me to his house to watch a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.48,0:08:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对自己个人生活 讳莫如深{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never shared a single detail of his personal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得对 他是个怪人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.39,0:08:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢大家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.69,0:08:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有请我们的新主管 探员O{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we will hear from our new chief, Agent O.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.10,0:08:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢探员K 感人至深的致辞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Agent K. That was very moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.56,0:08:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的悼词就这样吗 - 他是个好人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was your eulogy? - He was a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.87,0:09:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 异型朋友们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies, gentlemen, other life forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.40,0:09:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把Z的讣告传达给菲努斯星球的齐洛特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I told the Finucian Zyglot about Zed's passing,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.34,0:09:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她深表哀悼 让我来转述一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}she said something that I'm going to repeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.08,0:09:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,具体如下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm paraphrasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.44,0:09:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,客观地评价了Z的一生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just so Zed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.11,0:09:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.69,0:09:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是丢了魂魄 二愣子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lose something over here, Hondo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.49,0:09:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能答应我 如果我先走一步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you promise, if I go first,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.04,0:09:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的葬礼上说得更好些 行不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll do better than that at my funeral?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.26,0:09:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 可以说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, something like,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.46,0:10:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,J是我的好朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"J was a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.50,0:10:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他如今驾鹤西去 空余我惆怅独悲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now there's a big part of me that's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.67,0:10:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,J 我有好多话想对你说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, J, all the things that I should have said.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.17,0:10:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我老了 脾气又臭又倔强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}except I was too old and craggy and surly and just tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.43,0:10:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个老顽固{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was too tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能临风缅怀 缅怀你焦褐色的皮肤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm gonna just miss your caramel-brown skin."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.82,0:10:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 我会临时发挥的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll wing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.82,0:10:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,K 我是O 我们接到报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K, it's O. We have reports of.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.24,0:10:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人感染了外星蛔虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}several humans suffering from intestinal worms of alien origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.69,0:10:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 O{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, O.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.33,0:10:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么变成这副德性的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get to be like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.26,0:10:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定事出有因 到底怎么了 K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, something happened, K. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.50,0:10:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道我为什么能这么快乐吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how I live such a happy life?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.84,0:10:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还自以为「这么快乐」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you live such a happy life?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.60,0:10:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于不愿面对的问题 我从来不问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't ask questions I don't want to know the answer to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.78,0:10:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,真深刻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.42,0:11:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰弗里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeffrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.46,0:11:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认识吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.63,0:11:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家店的服务是无所不能的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your services are legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.72,0:11:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说从你爸开始就这样了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So says your father, Obadiah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.53,0:11:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在月桂冠监狱待过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in Lunar-Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.00,0:11:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有哪个监狱能关得住我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no prison that can hold me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.70,0:11:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,帅呆了 你想要什么呢 大哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool for you. What do you need from me, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.31,0:11:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,时光穿梭仪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The device.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.94,0:11:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要穿越回去杀个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going back in time to kill a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他把我的手臂打掉之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before he takes my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.83,0:11:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,K J 你们好啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K, J!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.00,0:11:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴又见面了 坐老位置吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So happy to see you. Mr. Wu get you your regular table?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.08,0:11:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不吃点东西吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You no hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.28,0:11:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要看看货仓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show us the tanks, Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.74,0:11:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 你们随便看 都是新鲜的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sure, sure. You look. Very fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.98,0:12:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要看最里面的那些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show us the tanks in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.25,0:12:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我英文不好 欢迎下次惠顾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So sorry. No speak English. You come back later, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.35,0:12:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,省省吧 这种骗旅客的废话 吴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save the chop-socky bullshit for the tourists, Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.76,0:12:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们百般刁难 让我蛋疼 为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what you guys wanna bust my balls for, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.86,0:12:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,疼什么疼 你又没有蛋蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have no balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友 看来你像是来自{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you look like you come from the planet…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.50,0:12:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋星球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.94,0:12:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃 这一次你明显违反了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Bob here is a clear violation of.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.21,0:12:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,健康法规第32条{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Health Ordinance 32.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.77,0:12:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,出售未经许可的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Selling unlicensed extraterrestrial.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.61,0:12:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,外星食材{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}foodstuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.91,0:12:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那鱼可是地球品种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is an Earth fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.72,0:12:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国的传统菜肴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very traditional in China.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.15,0:12:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是抓我 就是憎恨犯罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You arrest me, that's a hate crime!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.39,0:12:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也得有个前提 你是中国人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be if you were Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.96,0:12:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,K 拜托了 我还得养家糊口呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K, come on. I got larvae to feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.63,0:12:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,刺钉鱼是给谁准备的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is the Spiky Bulba for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.23,0:12:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没给谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.30,0:12:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,给谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's it for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.46,0:12:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我放着以备不时之需{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep them in case!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.63,0:12:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁有这个需求 - 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In case what? - I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.17,0:12:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都有可能啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.27,0:12:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你个鼻涕虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you slug.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.81,0:13:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,吴 他和我闹别扭 正在气头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wu, he and I are having issues in our relationship right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.75,0:13:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不该让你受到牵连{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you shouldn't have to suffer for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.58,0:13:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 J{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, J.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.45,0:13:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以要想不被「鱼」扇耳光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you don't like getting fish-slapped,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就给我乖乖地配合调查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need you to keep to our agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.75,0:13:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,给地球人上真正的地球鱼 别耍花招{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earth people get Earth fish. Real Earth fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.55,0:13:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜可怜我和卑微的孩子们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On behalf of my pathetic self and worthless children,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.06,0:13:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你们留下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.21,0:13:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我以无上的光荣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me most honorable benefit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.77,0:13:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你们煮一碗心爱的面条吧 K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of serving you favorite noodles, K?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.00,0:13:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁要吃你那烂面条 吴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't nobody want your nasty-ass noodles, Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.14,0:13:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的就是一坨屎 犯贱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a piece of shit, Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.96,0:13:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,加点虾和白菜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shrimp and bok choy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要在这儿待上一会儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna be here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.61,0:13:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点儿过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was just mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.62,0:13:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才对吴做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you did to Wu back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.52,0:13:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他的裙子都给剥了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snatched his skirt off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.86,0:13:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是无礼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just disrespectful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.19,0:13:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前和我爸玩过一个游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to play a game with my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.03,0:13:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫做「最后的晚餐吃什么」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'll You Have For Your Last Meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.46,0:13:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,比起这个来 可好多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could do worse than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.70,0:14:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.40,0:14:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也和我爸爸玩过一个游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to play a game with my dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.97,0:14:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫做「接球」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}called catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.17,0:14:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过 我是把球对着墙壁扔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except I'd throw the ball and it'd just hit the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.84,0:14:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他是个虚拟人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.64,0:14:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说你老爸的坏话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't badmouth your old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.05,0:14:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没在说他坏话 我只是从来不了解他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not badmouthing him. I just didn't really know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.72,0:14:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.88,0:14:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不对了 哪个小孩不需要父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right it's not. A little boy needs a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.12,0:14:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,1号桌什么都没点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Table one hasn't ordered a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.49,0:14:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,3号桌一直在喝鸭酱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Table three over there just drank his fourth cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.39,0:14:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝第四杯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of duck sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.72,0:14:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,K 今天上午坠地的飞船 是来自{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K, the crashed ship from this morning was stolen from.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.17,0:14:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,月桂冠监狱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lunar-Max Prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.00,0:14:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,孽畜鲍里斯干的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boris the Animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.13,0:14:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.34,0:14:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对刺钉鱼情有独钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a taste for Spiky Bulba.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.27,0:14:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,容后再议 头儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us a minute, will you, chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.84,0:14:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有活干了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in a situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.34,0:14:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.51,0:14:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去干掉克罗洛普{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take the Chloropod.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.68,0:14:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对付塔兰塔比{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take the Tarantabee.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.95,0:14:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那儿的海德洛尼安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Hydronian over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.65,0:14:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我负责厨房{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.85,0:14:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后在街上会合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet you on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.92,0:14:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正处在人生中的迷惘期呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a very confusing time in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.83,0:15:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,把嘴闭上 把头低下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your mouth closed, keep your head down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.28,0:17:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, K.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.89,0:17:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,孽畜鲍里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boris the Animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.39,0:17:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我 鲍里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just Boris.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.72,0:17:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是老样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't changed very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.41,0:17:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打断的胳膊 还是当初的样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see the arm I shot off is still shot off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.53,0:17:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我的胳膊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.93,0:17:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,40年了 我们彼此都对那一刻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've thought about that moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.30,0:17:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天念念不忘呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}every day for the last 40 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.87,0:17:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是积极的生活态度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's just not living a full life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.07,0:17:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证会比你活得更长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can promise you it will be longer than yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.94,0:17:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,也更孤单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lonelier too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.20,0:17:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是最后一个伯格罗蒂特人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you're the last Boglodite standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.95,0:17:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不好说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.85,0:17:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 我要先杀你为快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first, I want the pleasure of killing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.75,0:17:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, K.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.72,0:17:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你上哪儿去了 - 钓鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where the hell have you been? - Fishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.74,0:18:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能还不知道 K 你早就死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know it, K, but you're already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.85,0:18:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.60,0:18:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 请注意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I have everyone's attention, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.94,0:18:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.90,0:18:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how your kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.93,0:18:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,从学校跳蚤市场赚回一条金鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}won the goldfish in that little baggie from the school fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.03,0:18:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们觉得恶心 不想把它放在屋里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you didn't want that nasty thing in your house,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.91,0:18:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是就骗孩子说它跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you told your kid it ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.17,0:18:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而事实上是把金鱼扔进马桶冲掉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what you really did was flush it down the toilet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.51,0:18:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 这就是后果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.18,0:18:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗 所以说 别骗小孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? See what I'm talking about? Don't lie to your kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.19,0:18:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 我老了 干不动了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I am getting too old for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.46,0:18:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的感受 我只能想象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can only imagine how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.96,0:18:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,孽畜鲍里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boris the Animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.20,0:19:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把他关在牢里很久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put him away a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.80,0:19:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我犯的最大错误{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the worst mistake I ever made.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.90,0:19:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 他是无辜的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Was he innocent?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.14,0:19:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早该把他处决的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should have killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.91,0:19:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然这样 我们这就去把他干掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, shit, let's go get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.67,0:19:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.55,0:19:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不吗 - 你别插手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Leave it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.21,0:19:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这超出了你的执行级别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's above your pay grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.65,0:19:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是搭档 等级不是一样的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're partners. We have the same pay grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.72,0:19:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和你没关系 别管闲事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has nothing to do with you. Mind your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.15,0:19:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 首先{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, first of all,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.08,0:19:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,别用这种语气跟我说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's get a little bit of that bass out your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,其次 只要那刺钉佬还在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And secondly, as long as Spikey Boy is running around town,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.10,0:19:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就管定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is my whole business.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.46,0:19:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好别碰鲍里斯的案子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll forget about Boris.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.70,0:19:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我就在报告里说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or my report will reflect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.00,0:19:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你行为不当{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that your conduct has been unbecoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.50,0:19:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我也可以在报告里「检举」你 K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe my report is gonna reflect some shit too, K.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.67,0:19:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你被停职两周 - 才怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are suspended for two weeks. - Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.34,0:19:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就四周{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.07,0:19:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干脆辞了算了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about I quit?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.71,0:19:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些事情你不需要知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are things out there you do not need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.15,0:19:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当初招我的时候可没说这种鬼话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not the lie you told me when you recruited me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.46,0:20:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 潮男 搭档不理你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What up, pops? Lose your partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.11,0:20:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.16,0:20:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,前往阿法尊巴的下一班飞船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next shuttle to Afazumba.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.00,0:20:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,将在22分钟后起飞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaving in 22 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.25,0:20:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,检索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Search.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.12,0:20:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,孽畜鲍里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boris the Animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.28,0:20:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,孽畜鲍里斯 伯格罗蒂特杀手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boris the Animal, Boglodite assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.72,0:20:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯格罗蒂特人为凶残的外星种族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boglodites were a rogue alien race.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.69,0:20:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人毁星 无恶不作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that consumed all planets in their path.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.86,0:20:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生在地球上的外星人系列谋杀案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boris the Animal was the only suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.89,0:20:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,孽畜鲍里斯是唯一的嫌犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a series of alien murders committed on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.39,0:20:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看案件报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incident report.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.36,0:20:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为69年7月15日连环谋杀案的凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boris the Animal was convicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.06,0:20:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,孽畜鲍里斯被判有罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the following murders that occurred on July 15, 1969.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.10,0:20:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶案一 发生于康尼岛 10：37{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murder number one, Coney Island, 10: 37 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,受害人 寓言家罗曼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman the Fabulist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.81,0:20:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶案二 工厂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murder number two, the factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.11,0:20:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,精确检索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Refine search.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.94,0:20:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent K.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.01,0:20:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员新人K逮捕孽畜鲍里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Junior Agent K apprehended and arrested Boris the Animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.53,0:20:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间 1969年7月16日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on July 16, 1969,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.16,0:20:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,地点 佛罗里达州 卡纳维拉尔角{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at Cape Canaveral, Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.32,0:20:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡纳维拉尔角{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cape Canaveral…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.92,0:21:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,K探员被授予最高表彰 因为他的英勇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent K received highest commendation for heroic action.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.56,0:21:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及启用了天网防御系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}including implementation of the Arc Net Defense System.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.76,0:21:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护地球免遭伯格罗蒂特人入侵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which protected the Earth from Boglodite invasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.76,0:21:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,并成功消灭该种族{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and led to the race's extinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.66,0:21:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我详细资料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Details.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.66,0:21:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,访问受限{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Access restricted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.17,0:21:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,开玩笑吧 我是J{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me? Clearance level,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.44,0:21:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,资深探员 一级权限{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}senior agent, class one. J.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.64,0:21:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,访问被拒绝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Access denied.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.24,0:21:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.19,0:21:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么突然对搭档的既往史感兴趣了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why this sudden interest in your partner's old exploits?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.66,0:21:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍里斯和K到底怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened between Boris and K?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.50,0:21:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.60,0:21:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,K让鲍里斯蹲监狱 并布置了天网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K imprisoned Boris. He put up the Arc Net.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.80,0:21:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他使地球免于受伯格罗蒂特人的屠戮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He protected the Earth from the Boglodites.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.50,0:21:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,恪尽职守{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did his job.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.51,0:21:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我问的不是这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that's not what I'm asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.11,0:21:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡纳维拉尔角发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cape Canaveral, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.48,0:21:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他从此改变的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something that changed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.21,0:22:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再问了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave it at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.88,0:22:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩是不是原来有过一腿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you two go way back, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.59,0:22:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是机密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's classified.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.09,0:22:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点建议 探员J{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A word of advice, Agent J.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.49,0:22:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,别问那些你不想面对的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ask questions you don't want to know the answer to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.10,0:22:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思 K也是这么说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's funny. That is exactly what K said.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.41,0:22:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个睿智的男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a very wise man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.91,0:22:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚好好休息吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the rest of the night off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.83,0:22:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.93,0:22:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我该给你解释些什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I owe you some answers, hoss.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.40,0:22:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 突然就想开聊了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you're feeling chatty all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.77,0:22:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在不方便说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't talk right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.95,0:22:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有点私事要做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got secret cases of my own I'm working on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.54,0:23:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想打扰你玩游戏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to tear you away from your video game.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.54,0:23:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我要挂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm hanging up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.14,0:23:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道宇宙中破坏力最强的是什么吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the most destructive force in the universe?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.78,0:23:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,糖吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sugar?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.65,0:23:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是悔恨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.45,0:23:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,别停啊 接着说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to wait. Just talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.56,0:23:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想告诉你宇宙的秘密 没别的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promised you the secrets of the universe. Nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.43,0:23:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 宇宙还有连自己都不知道的秘密吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there's secrets out there that the universe don't know about?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.01,0:24:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.39,0:24:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问有什么事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.40,0:25:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,K在不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.27,0:25:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里可是5K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}5k.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.07,0:25:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 那是巧克力奶吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, is that chocolate milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.01,0:25:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以让我尝一口吗 真是抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I? I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.85,0:25:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知该怎么…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.78,0:25:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 总统在喝我的奶茶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, the president is drinking my milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.78,0:25:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.79,0:25:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没说「请」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't say please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.94,0:25:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,K来了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K get in yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.07,0:25:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,K是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.61,0:25:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你新来的吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You new?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.67,0:25:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,真会开玩笑 探员J{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very funny, Agent J.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.45,0:26:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,J 你昨天跟我说的 真是对极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}J, everything you told me yesterday, you were right as rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.42,0:26:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好盯了10小时梢 收获匪浅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God for that 10-hour stakeout.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.37,0:26:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是哪位啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.19,0:26:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我也觉得自己完全换了个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. I feel like a whole new man today.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.06,0:26:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,浑身一下子轻松了许多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like this great weight has been lifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.96,0:26:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去我一直都暴躁易怒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had anger issues my entire life,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.03,0:26:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我明白了 我气的是自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but now I see I was mad at myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.74,0:26:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我后妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my stepmom.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.77,0:26:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我要你现在就闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I'm gonna need you to stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.94,0:26:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就好像 我曾把情感封闭起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like I closed this emotional window.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.41,0:26:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但昨天 我用砖头砸开了封闭的窗户{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But yesterday I threw a brick through that window.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.61,0:26:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,J 谢谢你给我那块砖头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to thank you for handing me that brick, J.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.02,0:26:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你是谁 离我远点儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok, whoever you are, I need you to give me five feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.30,0:26:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则把你的声带扯断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I'll pluck you in your throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.08,0:26:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 温馨的黑衣人办公室再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok, I'm gonna go to the little Men's-in-Black room.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.62,0:26:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起找出那些来自灾星的白痴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we'll go find those morons from Pox Ethera.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.78,0:26:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,午饭我请{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lunch is on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.92,0:26:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.22,0:26:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,双A吗 你的搭档啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double A? Your partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.66,0:26:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我去拿杯巧克力奶茶 谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to go get me some chocolate milk, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.40,0:26:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,要一大杯 还有你看见K了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a really big glass. And have you seen K?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.23,0:26:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他病休了还是怎么的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he call in sick or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.94,0:26:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,K是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's K?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.37,0:26:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 你去吧 去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right, go ahead, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.98,0:26:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.01,0:26:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.45,0:26:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们赢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.98,0:27:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我承认 非常有趣 非常到位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give it to you. It's funny, very elaborate.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.42,0:27:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们各位 演得棒极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and all of you, fantastic performances.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.75,0:27:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信 14年了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't believe you waited 14 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.99,0:27:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们才开始有一点幽默感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to develop a sense of humor,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.62,0:27:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这次真绝了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this is a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.49,0:27:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是K 我要你马上给我出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But K, I need you to come out here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.49,0:27:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,再不出来 我要生气了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I'm starting to get a little pissed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.10,0:27:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员J 请你把嗓门放低点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent J, would you mind keeping your voice down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.53,0:27:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你在找谁 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and telling me who it is you're looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.60,0:27:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在找K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for K.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.13,0:27:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,K是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is K?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.64,0:27:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么搞的 连你也这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too? You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.17,0:27:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 他是你什么人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, who is he to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.31,0:27:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我搭档{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.91,0:27:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,老头子 110岁了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Older gentleman, 110…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.28,0:27:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者 111岁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe 111 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.48,0:27:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,阴沉不定 又有点猫王的气质{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of a surly, Elvis thing happening with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.52,0:27:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑起来这个样子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He smiles like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.42,0:27:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有印象了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seen him around?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.22,0:27:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你去见他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take you to K.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.92,0:27:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.07,0:27:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这什么玩意 - 这就是K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is that supposed to be? - That's K.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.70,0:27:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了40多年了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been dead for over 40 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.67,0:28:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 你要开玩笑 也得有个笑点吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, see, the prerequisite for a joke is that it be funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.94,0:28:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这根本就不是玩笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's never been funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.88,0:28:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,资料检索 探员K和孽畜鲍里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computer, Agent K and Boris the Animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.15,0:28:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑超特警组案件报告 1969年7月{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men in Black incident report, July, 1969.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.02,0:28:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,地点 卡纳维拉尔角{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Location, Cape Canaveral.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.36,0:28:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶犯孽畜鲍里斯逃离地球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perpetrator Boris the Animal escaped and fled Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.89,0:28:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,被认为已返回{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assumed to have returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.10,0:28:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,20光年之外的伯格罗蒂亚星球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to planet Boglodotia 20 light-years away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.33,0:28:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员K在案发现场壮烈牺牲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent K pronounced dead at scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.97,0:28:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,被追授荣誉表彰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awarded posthumous commendation for action.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.83,0:28:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,其行动使人员伤亡降至最低{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which prevented greater loss of human life.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.90,0:28:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是事实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.57,0:28:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过这报告 是K把鲍里斯抓起来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I looked at this report. K put Boris away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.71,0:28:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,K已经死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent K is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.20,0:28:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我昨晚还和他通话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I just talked to him last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.84,0:28:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在胡思乱想 - 我才没有乱想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are imagining. - I'm not imagining anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.41,0:28:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马上呼叫心理医疗队 - 遵命 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need a psych team up here right now. - Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.55,0:28:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刮完脸用的是韦尔瓦须后水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aqua Velva aftershave.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.76,0:28:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是我能乱想出来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't imagine that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.55,0:28:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次盯梢 他都不停地放牛仔音乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every stakeout, endless hours of cowboy music.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.26,0:28:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天早晨喝咖啡 他都会说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every morning with his coffee, he'd say,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.07,0:28:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 我告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'll tell you something, slick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.24,0:28:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这咖啡喝起来有股土渣味{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This coffee tastes like dirt."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.56,0:28:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会说 知足吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was supposed to say, "What do you expect?"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.63,0:28:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可是今天早上刚磨的 - 刚磨的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "It was ground this morning." - "This morning."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.80,0:29:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.57,0:29:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 巧克力奶茶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chocolate milk, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.04,0:29:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死哪儿去了 都有一个小时了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you been, man? It was like an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.11,0:29:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.04,0:29:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候开始喜欢喝巧克力奶的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you been craving chocolatized dairy products?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.08,0:29:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就今天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just today.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.21,0:29:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在是不是有点头痛 头晕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you experiencing headaches? Dizziness?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.42,0:29:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,腿脚不稳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loss of balance?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.08,0:29:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,情绪激动 郁闷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agitation? Depression?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.82,0:29:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.42,0:29:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两种可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.65,0:29:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一是你被霍瓦蒂脑虫咬了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One is you've been bitten by a Hovartian brain tick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.53,0:29:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时可能剧痛而死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and could die in horrible agony at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.60,0:29:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕 不是脑虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it. It's not the tick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.57,0:29:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没被脑虫咬还糟糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Damn it, it's not the tick"?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.67,0:29:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道还有比这更糟糕的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's something worse than the tick?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.84,0:29:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对巧克力奶的痴迷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your obsession with chocolate milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.18,0:29:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,表明你可能曾被吸入时空裂口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}indicates that you might be involved in a temporal fracture.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.98,0:29:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.95,0:29:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,巧克力奶可以缓解时空碎裂造成的头痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chocolate milk relieves temporal-fracture headaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.85,0:29:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时空裂口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a temporal fracture?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.35,0:29:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种历史时间轴的断裂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A break in the timeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.55,0:29:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.65,0:29:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,时空旅行 历史穿越{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time travel! Time travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.96,0:29:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里有什么时空旅行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no such thing as time travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.26,0:29:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这就是啊 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, there is. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.86,0:30:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.13,0:30:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真有这种事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if there were.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.83,0:30:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我这样资深的高级探员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A class-one senior agent such as myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.87,0:30:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道一点都没感觉吗 更不用说K了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}would have been aware of it, wouldn't he have?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.60,0:30:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非他也没达到级别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were it not classified and way above his pay grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.34,0:30:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要求升级{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I need a raise.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.97,0:30:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个龌龊的人 名叫俄巴底亚·普莱斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was one man, scumbag, Obadiah Price.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.44,0:30:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想搞时空旅行 被我们阻止了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He figured it out, we busted him,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.41,0:30:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以非法穿越时空罪将他逮捕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we made time travel illegal throughout the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.56,0:30:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在月桂冠监狱服刑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he is serving life on Lunar-Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.48,0:30:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 鲍里斯就关在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's where Boris was locked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.59,0:30:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果鲍里斯掌握了穿越技术{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Boris worked out how to time jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.52,0:30:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,会严重地改变历史进程{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he could seriously change the course of history.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.16,0:30:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意 早期预警系统启动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention. Early warning system engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.03,0:30:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有侵略战舰进入太阳系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inbound hostile warships entering solar system.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.90,0:30:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,经探测 发现了伯格罗蒂特标识及语言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boglodite markings and language detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.14,0:30:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯格罗蒂特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boglodite.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.19,0:30:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍里斯就是伯格罗蒂特人 他们早灭绝了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boris is a Boglodite, but they're extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.74,0:30:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然还没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.21,0:30:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球即将遭受灾难性攻击{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catastrophic Earth attack imminent.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.74,0:30:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动天网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put up the Arc Net.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.35,0:30:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.15,0:30:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网 防御系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Arc Net. The defense system.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.11,0:30:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,K为防御伯格罗蒂特人设置的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K got it for the Boglodites.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.02,0:30:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,K早就不在人世了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no K.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.69,0:31:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经死了40年了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been dead for over 40 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.16,0:31:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有K就没有防御系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No K. No defense system.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.16,0:31:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍里斯穿越回去杀了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boris jumped back and killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.86,0:31:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要拯救世界 就必须阻止这件事发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wanna save the world, stop that from happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.20,0:31:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得去找杰弗里·普莱斯 俄巴底亚的儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to find Jeffrey Price. He's Obadiah's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.90,0:31:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望那小子还没有穿越回过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hope the little squirt hasn't skipped town.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.26,0:31:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么需要吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.32,0:31:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在电池正惊爆促销中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're having an amazing sale on batteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.66,0:31:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动 我们还有其它商品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we got other stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.20,0:31:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,耳机 适配器…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}like headphones, adapters or…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.67,0:31:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你帮鲍里斯穿越时空的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You helped Boris the Animal time jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.67,0:31:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确 但我没得选 那家伙是个怪物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I had to. That dude's a freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.80,0:31:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了我搭档{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed my partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.97,0:31:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要知道他穿越的时间和地点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know when and where you sent him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.54,0:31:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你当我是记事本吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you think I keep, like, a logbook?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.05,0:32:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,发送目标 1969年7月16日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target vector, July-16-1969.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.62,0:32:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.72,0:32:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友的不幸我深表遗憾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a real bummer about your buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.62,0:32:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确信他是个好人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure he was a great guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.26,0:32:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对于整个时空连续体来说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in terms of the space-time continuum.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.46,0:32:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是雷达屏幕上的一个小小光点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}your friend was a little blip on the historical radar!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.97,0:32:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真是个大光点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a big blip.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.83,0:32:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你是什么计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. What's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.50,0:32:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我传回到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna send me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.30,0:32:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,1969年7月15日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to July 15th, 1969.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.41,0:32:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这很愚蠢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's a stupid plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.25,0:32:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我把鲍里斯传回了7月16日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I sent Boris to July 16th.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.34,0:32:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不担心那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not worried about that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.50,0:32:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要赶在老鲍里斯出现前杀掉小鲍里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill the younger Boris before the older one shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.01,0:32:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样他们两个就都不存在了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way, neither of them will even exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.65,0:32:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪不得你能穿上这黑西装{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you get to wear the black suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.09,0:32:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不来碰一下手吗 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna leave me hanging? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.36,0:32:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有个问题 即使你回去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I just thought of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.85,0:32:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约当时也算是数一数二的大都市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even back then New York was like a big-ish city.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.29,0:32:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么找到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how are you gonna really find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.36,0:32:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,7月15日 鲍里斯在康尼岛上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On July 15th, Boris killed an alien,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.62,0:32:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了一个外星人 寓言家罗曼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman the Fabulist, at Coney lsland.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.00,0:32:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想守株待兔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna get there first and be waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.34,0:32:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 他们得给你两套黑西装{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, they should give you two black suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.64,0:33:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 正经点行吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My man, for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.24,0:33:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.24,0:33:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真家伙 时空跳跃器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the real deal. Time-jump gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.31,0:33:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常稀有 非常古老{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very rare, very old.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.15,0:33:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但首先 我们得去个高点的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first, we gotta get high.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.55,0:33:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 别这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.25,0:33:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我指的不是嗑高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, I mean, really high.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.51,0:33:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 拉一把{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man? A little help here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.52,0:33:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.85,0:33:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道时空穿越的规矩吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the rules of time jumps?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.50,0:33:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我概括一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the short version.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.02,0:33:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果想救你搭档 奉劝你一句{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You wanna save your partner, word of advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.99,0:33:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,离他远点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.70,0:33:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了 远离K 杀了鲍瑞斯就行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, got it. Stay away from K. Just kill Boris.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.36,0:34:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 拿好这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, take these.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.37,0:34:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去的路上风相当大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gets pretty windy on the way down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.37,0:34:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去的路上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way down?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.67,0:34:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果迎风流泪就没法读数了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With eyes tearing up, it's hard to read the dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.17,0:34:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会让你看上去像真正的穿行者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, it helps you look like a real time traveler,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.86,0:34:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷毙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.74,0:34:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不从这个鬼地方跳下去呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not jumping off of this building!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.01,0:34:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,时空跳跃的关键在于「跳」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.12,0:34:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 现在把时间设定到15日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now I gotta set this thing to the 15th.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.19,0:34:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来差不多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That seems right-ish.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.39,0:34:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,万事俱备 只欠一跳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now… all you gotta do is jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.86,0:34:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, stop. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.43,0:34:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要下落的速度够快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're moving fast enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.33,0:34:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个圆圈就会被某种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that circle is gonna fill.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.63,0:34:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿色的时空穿梭液填满{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}up with some sort of green time-travel liquid.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.04,0:34:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后会变得很亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's gonna glow really bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.94,0:34:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候 你就要切断蓝色镭射线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as that happens, break that blue laser line.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.74,0:34:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,用大拇指划一圈就行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your thumb to complete the circuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.88,0:34:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前的高度应该是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At this height, that should be…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.08,0:34:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我算算{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.50,0:34:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球的重力加速度大约是每分钟9米{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}mass of Earth and 30-something feet per minute…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.15,0:34:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是9.8米每秒 每秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 32 feet per second. Per second.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.79,0:34:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 差不多吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds right-ish.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.92,0:34:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么大概就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that would be,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.01,0:34:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜 大概是离地0.6米左右吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess, about two feet off the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.43,0:35:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那儿阻断镭射线吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I break the laser line?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.89,0:35:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要碰它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't break it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.06,0:35:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 当我够快时 - 说的没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, when I'm fast enough! - Sounds good!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.16,0:35:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那到底要不要阻断镭射线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I break the laser line or do I not break the laser line?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.27,0:35:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别丢了时空穿越器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not lose that time device.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.44,0:35:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你就回不来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you will be stuck in 1969!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.57,0:35:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,1969对你可不是什么好年代{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't the best time for your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.61,0:35:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 如今的世界多精彩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying. It's, like, a lot cooler now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.78,0:35:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道它能不能工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will I know if it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.48,0:35:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了就能知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll either know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.28,0:35:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么就是死翘翘了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.96,0:35:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定是很喜欢他 才会这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must really love this guy to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.39,0:35:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 为什么就我记得K 其他人却不记得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wait. How come I remember K, but nobody else does?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.60,0:35:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就是说你已经在那儿了 - 那儿是哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That means you were there! - I was where?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.40,0:35:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你没死 回来要把一切都告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you survive, you gotta come back and tell me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.47,0:35:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去哪儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where was I?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.81,0:35:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.01,0:35:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.99,0:36:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.78,0:38:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老兄 今天星期几 - 星期二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My man, what's today? - Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.92,0:38:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 日期呢 - 15号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The date? - The 15th.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.59,0:38:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 几月份 - 7月{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of? - July.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.32,0:38:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪一年呢 朋友 - 1969{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dog, the year. - 1969.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.63,0:38:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.63,0:38:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我怎么跟看疯子似的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me like I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.23,0:38:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我们办入住登记 - 好的 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get us checked in. - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.90,0:38:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托认真些好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey, do me a favor, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.70,0:39:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 搬行李小心点 - 我会的 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Be careful with the luggage. - Absolutely, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.90,0:39:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个行李箱可花了我不少钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I paid a lot of money for that luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.40,0:39:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会小心的 - 上次我住这儿就蹭花了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll take good care. - Last time, it got scuffed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.34,0:39:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来吧 先生 有什么需要就打电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go, sir. Just call down when you need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.91,0:39:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,后备箱里还有行李呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more in the trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.38,0:39:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,会给您送到房间的 先生 您只管进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it'll be in your room, sir. Just go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.68,0:39:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问… 那个谁 你是哪位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Excuse me, who is that? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.76,0:39:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.54,0:39:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,帅呆了 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Far out, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.15,0:39:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,再乱摸 剁了你的手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to keep that, I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.05,0:39:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,多做爱 别打仗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make love, not war.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.15,0:39:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我两样都喜欢做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer to do both.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.89,0:40:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好 长官 有什么需要帮忙的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you, officers? What can I do you for?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.09,0:40:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个 高档车窗 高档座椅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look at this. Power windows, power seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.70,0:40:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌这至少值六千美元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bet you it cost 6 grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.63,0:40:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 它还有个顶篷 收起来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and it has a roof, but it's hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.33,0:40:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是干什么的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what kind of work do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.27,0:40:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸡窝里飞出的凤凰吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An individual of your particular ethnic persuasion?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.11,0:40:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定他是个体育明星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's a noted athlete.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.28,0:40:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 底特律黑人队的首发前锋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Starting forward for the Detroit Darkies.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.45,0:41:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你从哪儿弄来的这辆车 - 还有这行头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where'd you get the car? - And the suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.72,0:41:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我偷的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stole them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.73,0:41:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,车从你老婆那儿 行头从你奶奶那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Car from your wife suit from your grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.03,0:41:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我们找到了啥 私藏武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we have here? Concealed weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.03,0:41:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他奶奶衣服里的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's his grandmother's suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.13,0:41:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么 - 嗑药用的吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, what's this? - Probably drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.10,0:41:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要乱碰上面的按钮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have rights and I demand to see my lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.54,0:41:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有权利先召见我的律师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you press that small button on the side firmly.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.64,0:41:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,按吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Press it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.64,0:41:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 那是标准记忆消除器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, gentlemen, is a standard-issue neuralyzer.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.81,0:41:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们不会记得它的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.45,0:41:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能仅仅因为看见黑人开了辆好车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And just because you see a black man driving a nice car.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.35,0:41:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,就怀疑他是小偷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}does not mean it's stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.49,0:41:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是偷了这辆车 可不因为我是黑人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stole that one. But not because I'm black.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.16,0:41:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这车我马上就用完 待会儿你们找到车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be done with the car in a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.07,0:41:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,就还给罗斯福饭店的那个蠢货吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just find it and take it back to the jerk at the Roosevelt Hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.52,0:42:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个阿卡南人在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the Archanan?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.65,0:42:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来得太晚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.92,0:42:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要把天网送给人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is going to give the humans the Arc Net.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.53,0:42:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不这么想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's agree to disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.33,0:42:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会抓住他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.06,0:42:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.06,0:42:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,K K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K! K!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.25,0:43:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸 我在地球上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, I'm on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.22,0:43:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要保释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need bail.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.00,0:43:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,开蓝色飞行舰的旅客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will the owner of a blue warp-speed cruiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.57,0:43:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,请到前台报道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}please report to the front desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.94,0:43:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该把那玩意的电压调低点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to turn the electricity down on that damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.64,0:43:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我舌头都木了 K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't taste my fricking tongue, K.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.98,0:43:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.11,0:43:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 因为我叫你K吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Because I called you "K"?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.12,0:43:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我管谁都叫K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I call everybody K.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.29,0:43:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的癖好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of my thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.82,0:43:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What up, K?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.26,0:43:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我有点… K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I sort of… K.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.29,0:43:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 这是我的个性 有些人喜欢这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's kind of my thing. I just… Some people like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.03,0:43:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,大多数人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most people.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.40,0:44:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我知道你扯谎时的样子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that I know what you look like when you're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.76,0:44:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,何不让我看看你讲真话是什么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me what you look like when you're telling the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.04,0:44:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是我在康尼岛游乐场套圈赢的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won those at Coney Island on the ring toss.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.91,0:44:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在那赢过泰迪熊 但从没赢过这些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won a stuffed bear once, but never one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.54,0:44:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,运气不错嘛 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be good, slick.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.65,0:44:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 长官 我还有正经事要做呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, sir, I was minding my own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.35,0:44:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在那儿等女朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was waiting for my girl, who,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.68,0:44:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在她可能正着急找我呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the way is probably worried sick looking for me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.49,0:44:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我需要拿上我的东西回去见她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I just need my things and I need to get back to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.66,0:44:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫什么名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.13,0:44:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你女友 她叫什么名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your gal, what's her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.83,0:44:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,史泰伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Schtaron.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.83,0:44:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,史泰伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Schtaron?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.51,0:44:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌史泰伦很喜欢你的黑西装{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet Schtaron likes that suit of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.84,0:44:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 穿黑西装有罪吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, it's a crime to wear a black suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.01,0:44:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,废话少说 我又没做什么错事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen. I haven't done anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.01,0:44:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛要待在这里陪你聊天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need to get out of here. I cannot be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.58,0:44:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.42,0:44:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,X对康尼岛的事已经很不爽了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}X is frightfully upset about the whole Coney Island incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.95,0:44:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢你的提醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the heads-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.02,0:45:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这咖啡喝起来有股土渣味{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, this coffee tastes like dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.99,0:45:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,知足吧 这咖啡…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you expect? It was…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.42,0:45:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是早上刚磨的呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just ground this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.70,0:45:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,O{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}O?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.70,0:45:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 我统称女士为O{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I call ladies "O".
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.84,0:45:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说O是女士 K是男士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To me, O is feminine, K is masculine.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.04,0:45:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果见到情侣 我就会说O-K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I see a couple, I'm like, "O-K."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.71,0:45:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么乱七八糟的 有伤亡吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a mess. Any casualties?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.28,0:45:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 寓言家罗曼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Roman the Fabulist.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.35,0:45:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类伤亡呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any human casualties?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.22,0:45:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.89,0:45:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.59,0:45:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I was…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.93,0:45:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到的闲杂人员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stray human caught in the net.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.50,0:45:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他编码43 再扔回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code 43 him and throw him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.10,0:45:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 您与瓦格兰星人的会议要迟到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're late for a meeting with the Viagrans.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.36,0:45:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们研制出了开创性的新药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have a revolutionary new pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.63,0:45:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可真是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's really…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.54,0:45:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着说 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, slick.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.41,0:45:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在等我的妞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was waiting for my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.81,0:45:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,史泰伦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Schtaron.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.04,0:45:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 她是希腊人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, she's Greek.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.91,0:45:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 还剩最后一件事 眼睛检查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Just one last thing. An eye exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.59,0:46:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是眼科检查 K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not an eye exam, K.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.74,0:46:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是大号记忆消除器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a big-ass neuralyzer!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.59,0:46:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道很多事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a lot of information.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.96,0:46:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个普通人不会知道这么多事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a fella who doesn't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.93,0:46:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂你意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.90,0:46:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,K 我们得暂停一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, K, we need to hold up a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.10,0:46:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个护齿咬嘴里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get this bite guard in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.94,0:46:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,退下 退下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, back up, back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.77,0:46:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,K 我想我们刚才有些误会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K, listen, I think we got off on the wrong foot, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.78,0:46:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得再谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's just stop for a second and talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.28,0:46:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把我放进这里 K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't put me in here, K!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.15,0:46:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,太晚了 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late, hoss.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.48,0:46:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 K 这案子我能帮上忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K, no, listen to me. I can help you with this case!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.45,0:46:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.12,0:46:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在表情很真诚 你会后悔莫及的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing the truth face! You're missing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.76,0:46:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我看不到你的脸 只能想象了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just use my imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.80,0:46:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,K 你在追捕的杀手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K, the killer you're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.93,0:46:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是我在追捕的那个伯格罗蒂特人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm after the same guy. A Boglodite.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.80,0:46:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫鲍里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Boris.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.00,0:46:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就开始了 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ship has sailed, amigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.30,0:46:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不干掉他 就会出现两个本体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't get him, there'll be two.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.30,0:46:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在认真听着呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had my undivided attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.31,0:46:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个只有一个胳膊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One will have one arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.61,0:46:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个肢体健全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one's gonna have two. K!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.48,0:46:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,K 听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.98,0:46:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你清除我的记忆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you erase me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.11,0:47:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就等于清除了整个世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you erase the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.32,0:47:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,消除记忆 15秒倒计时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteen seconds to neuralyzation.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.38,0:47:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,14{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fourteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.39,0:47:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,13 12{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirteen. Twelve.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.62,0:47:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,11 10 9{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eleven. Ten. Nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.69,0:47:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天见到鲍里斯 杀了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you see Boris tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.70,0:47:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要逮捕 直接干掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K, kill him. Do not arrest him, kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.00,0:47:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,4 3 2{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four. Three. Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.51,0:47:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这机器停了吗 我觉得还没停{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this thing off? Hey, I don't think it's all the way off, K!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.74,0:47:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在嗡嗡作响的 K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's whirring and buzzing.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.61,0:47:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我是不是什么都不记得了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if I don't know nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.85,0:47:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识罗曼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.55,0:47:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他老婆曾为我做过晚餐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His wife cooked me dinner once.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.49,0:47:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽说过程不怎么愉快 但他是我朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}While it was not pleasant, he was my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.53,0:47:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后机会 你是谁 你都知道什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last chance, who are you and what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.37,0:47:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来自未来的黑超特警{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an agent from the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.50,0:47:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是搭档{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.27,0:47:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,25年后 你召我入局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 25 years, you'll recruit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.14,0:48:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着14年后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and 14 years after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.42,0:48:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你阻止我杀的那个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the guy you didn't let me kill today.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.38,0:48:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍里斯 逃出监狱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}escapes from prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.05,0:48:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿越回过去然后对地球发动大规模入侵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}jumps to the past and unleashes an invasion of Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.40,0:48:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还剩下19个小时时间干掉他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got about 19 hours to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.38,0:48:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以现在我们真的得抓紧了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, really, we need to go right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.06,0:48:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.47,0:48:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就这么信了啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's the story you believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.40,0:48:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one was the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.60,0:48:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能不全是真的 但是现在只能这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't the whole truth, but it'll do for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.87,0:48:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么 当然都是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? Of course it's the whole truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.17,0:48:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 一旦你开始说谎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The problem with a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.24,0:48:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人就不怎么相信你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is once you start lying you put yourself…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.31,0:48:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent K.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.48,0:48:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么还在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he still doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.98,0:48:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我审问他太长时间了 送他出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might have cooked him too long. Thought I'd walk him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.95,0:48:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我穿裤子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put my pants on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.50,0:48:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 未来人 现在去哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, future man, where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.50,0:49:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.77,0:49:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.94,0:49:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 去你上次去的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Go wherever you went last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.97,0:49:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没去呢 我告诉你去哪里了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't been here. I didn't tell you where I went?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.61,0:49:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我们不常交流{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I mean, we don't really talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.91,0:49:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么搭档啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of partners sit in.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.22,0:49:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,14年来每天都坐同一辆车却不说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a car every day for 14 years and don't talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.95,0:49:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确如此 问题就是这么造成的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. And this is the type of problem it causes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.26,0:49:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太不正常了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dysfunctional.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.52,0:49:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 你最好能赶紧帮上点忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, sport, you better get useful real quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.03,0:49:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我送你回43号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you go back in room 43.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.10,0:49:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.80,0:49:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,档案里好像提到了什么工厂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was something in the file about a factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.80,0:49:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在工厂里发生了一些事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something happened at a factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.97,0:49:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以把你招数都使出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look, man, you can put your Jedi Knight on me all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.98,0:49:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我就知道这么多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.55,0:49:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让你想起什么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That spark something?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.85,0:49:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼被杀的时候身上带着这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman had this on his person when he was murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.02,0:49:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个火柴盒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a matchbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.89,0:50:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这是个线索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.96,0:50:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不抽烟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.23,0:50:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是丢了魂魄 二愣子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lose something over here, Hondo?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.53,0:50:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.06,0:50:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你今年贵庚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, how old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.00,0:50:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,29{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.00,0:50:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真是显老{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got some city miles on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.30,0:50:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始明白我们为什么不说话了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starting to understand why we don't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.18,0:50:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道这个地方 - 它很出名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How well do you know this place? - I know its reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.35,0:51:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢这样瞎打瞎撞 我要我的枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like it. I hate going in blind. I'm gonna need my gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.69,0:51:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure thing, slick.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.59,0:51:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,K 等等 我得跟你一起去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K! Wait, no, I gotta go in with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.26,0:51:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实坐着 我没问题的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sit tight. I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.13,0:51:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.43,0:51:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,K 别一个人进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K, don't go in by yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.84,0:51:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.97,0:51:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要见老板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need to see the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.71,0:51:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他忙着呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.04,0:51:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那我就自己看看了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm gonna just take a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.79,0:51:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们要僵持一下了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we have ourselves a standoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.39,0:51:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.29,0:51:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是把钥匙藏在烟灰缸下面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still keep the key under the ashtray.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.31,0:51:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你猜到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.63,0:51:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才我们谈到哪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.37,0:51:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正要告诉你滚开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was about to tell you to screw off.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.40,0:51:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 你在未来打保龄球吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, slick, you bowl in the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.44,0:51:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是蝉联三届的黑超联赛冠军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}MIB league champ, three years running.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.77,0:51:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那来露一手吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.41,0:51:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能就这么闯进我的地盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did not walk into my establishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.81,0:51:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还拧下我的脑袋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and rip my head off!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.78,0:52:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 我们没多少时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My man, we don't have a lot of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.48,0:52:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是老实交代吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really need to tell him something.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.45,0:52:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你们吃点苦头的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell him this!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.28,0:52:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 就用你的头了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.45,0:52:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你敢扔我的头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Hey, if you do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.33,0:52:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会放过你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am gonna hunt you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.62,0:52:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你在地球的下半生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and make sure you walk funny for the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.63,0:52:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,都过得很惨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of your miserable last days on Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.80,0:52:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,吹牛了吧 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tough spare, slick.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.96,0:52:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们惹错人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You messed with the wrong head!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.40,0:52:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的头有点…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His head's a little…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.95,0:52:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得告诉我们多姆在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna tell us where Dom is?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.40,0:52:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会杀了你们两个的 你们两个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill you both. I'll kill both of youse!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.01,0:52:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,球没拿稳是吧 需要我擦擦吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hook's a little off. Want me to clean her?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.44,0:52:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然了 - 别 别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure thing. - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.71,0:52:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用这玩意儿清理过洗手间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I just cleaned the bathroom with this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.15,0:52:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别擦了 别擦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No cleaning! No cleaning!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.62,0:52:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我投降 他在后面办公室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay! Okay, all right! All right, he's in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.79,0:52:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他不会和你们黑衣人渣说什么的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's not gonna talk to Men in Black scum like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.52,0:52:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的头还我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now give me back my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.79,0:52:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,K 我把这个叫低手球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K, I call this one "Low Hanging Fruit."
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.96,0:52:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个不是球洞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ain't a finger hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.36,0:52:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you sick bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.23,0:52:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你的头拧下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll pop your head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.57,0:52:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你也尝尝这滋味{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see how you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.57,0:52:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你们两个都杀了的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.24,0:53:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了你们俩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill the both of youself!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.47,0:53:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill you both!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.48,0:53:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们路线没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're on the right track.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.78,0:53:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是选错了车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the wrong train.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.82,0:53:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他有任何秘密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he had any secrets…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.32,0:53:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,估计已经被鲍里斯榨出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing he spilled them.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.99,0:53:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明人会找出受害者的共同点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A smart man figures out what victims have in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.52,0:53:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A smart man would.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.19,0:53:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这电话屁股真大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a big-ass phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.61,0:53:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能把它往脸上贴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't put that up to your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.32,0:53:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,O探员吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent O.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.48,0:53:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好吗 探员K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's your day been, Agent K?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.60,0:53:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,凑合吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair to middling.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.85,0:53:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那边怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are things going?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.02,0:53:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 多谢关心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.42,0:53:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是一小时前才见过面吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you saw her like an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.32,0:53:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,找人清理一下宇宙保龄球馆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need cleanup and containment at Cosmic Lanes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.69,0:53:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发现了一个被杀的帕拉星人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I got a dead Parlaxian.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.80,0:53:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼是巴沃德星人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now Roman was a Byvoid,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.31,0:53:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,和帕拉星属于同一个星群{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}correct me if I'm wrong…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.67,0:53:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的对不对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the same planetary grouping?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.50,0:53:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 它们都是三角星系的成员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, a three planet system in the Triangulum Galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.47,0:53:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,被伯格罗蒂特星人悉数消灭了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}wiped out by the Boglodites.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.87,0:53:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那第三个星球是不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The third planet, wasn't it…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.24,0:53:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格莱美亚星 - 格莱美亚星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Glamouria? - Glamouria.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.68,0:53:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 O小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Miss O.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.84,0:53:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道鲍里斯下面要去哪儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where Boris is headed to next.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.51,0:53:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前说对了 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were close, slick.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.59,0:53:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过不是普通厂房 是「梦」工厂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a factory, it's the Factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.99,0:54:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果鲍里斯真的在里面 我要杀了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if Boris turns out to be here, I'm gonna kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.19,0:54:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need my gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.50,0:54:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,做梦吧你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.66,0:54:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经做了14年的探员了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been an agent for 14 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.33,0:54:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以在这个案子上我是老手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means I'm the senior agent on this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.55,0:54:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想拿职位压你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I hate to pull rank…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.04,0:54:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我这是在要求新人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I am instructing my junior agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.24,0:54:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是你 立刻把枪给我 这是命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's you, to give me my gun right now. That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.11,0:54:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这个 太空枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, space gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.75,0:54:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.12,0:54:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没说要谢你啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.73,0:54:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的丑八怪也能在地球上活得人模人样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For such an ungainly species, they've thrived on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.39,0:54:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在做探员3年后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was an agent for three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.13,0:54:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,才知道这些模特都是外星人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I realized all models were aliens.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.37,0:54:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是通过很崎岖的方式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found out the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.90,0:54:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,口令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Password?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.87,0:54:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 60年代土俗的小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look, funky '60s dude,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.52,0:54:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没空跟你啰嗦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we don't have a lot of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.64,0:54:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹尼斯·乔普林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janis Joplin.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.25,0:55:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有不是外星人吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anybody here who's not an alien?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.02,0:55:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.76,0:55:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,眨眼 不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blink. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.09,0:55:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,看镜头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look in the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.33,0:55:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是安迪·沃霍尔吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that Andy Warhol?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.10,0:55:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.33,0:55:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰了 沃霍尔先生 能借一步说话吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, Mr. Warhol, could we have a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.74,0:55:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在没空 我正在进行中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now is not a good time. This is a be-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.44,0:55:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就问几个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.84,0:55:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不问 不答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No questions. No answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.18,0:55:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在进行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just being.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.18,0:55:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有急事需要问您{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have an urgent matter to discuss with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.58,0:55:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于您这次聚会的一个客人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}regarding one of your party guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.79,0:55:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们下周再来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.42,0:55:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,等发生的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}next week, after the happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.59,0:55:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了以后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}has happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.26,0:55:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 沃霍尔先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Mr. Warhol.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.81,0:55:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,您说话速度太慢 但我们时间紧任务重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like talking slow. We got stuff to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.56,0:55:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个星球还等着我去救呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a planet to save.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.67,0:55:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好烦人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're distressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.43,0:55:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌你 讨厌你的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything about you upsets me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.94,0:56:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的K 你要让我身份曝光吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, K! Are you trying to blow my cover?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.14,0:56:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员W 你的身份安全得很{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent W, your cover is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.14,0:56:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 安迪·沃霍尔是我们的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, Andy Warhol is one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.01,0:56:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.01,0:56:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗 我已经无计可施了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You out of your mind? I'm so out of ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.18,0:56:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只能画画罐头 描描香蕉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm painting soup cans and bananas for chris sakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.65,0:56:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃霍尔先生 你得知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, Mr. Warhol, I gotta tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.49,0:56:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我特喜欢你的作品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.59,0:56:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.99,0:56:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个蠢货是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the dumb-ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.09,0:56:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,您能有点儿职业礼节吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a little professional courtesy here?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.39,0:56:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说啥 蠢货 - 再说一遍试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that, dumb-ass? - Say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.86,0:56:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想听吗 - 你敢说吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Want me to? - I dare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.20,0:56:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dumb-ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.16,0:56:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.63,0:56:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你是名人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I have no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.69,0:56:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,照样揍得你面目全非屁滚尿流{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}pimp-slapping the shiznit out of Andy Warhol.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.00,0:56:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.24,0:56:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛看我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you looking at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.25,0:56:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么这样吧 探员K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, all right. You know what? Agent K.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.75,0:56:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,何不让你和探员W单独交流一下心得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you see what information you can get from Agent W.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.62,0:56:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出去转转{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll go case the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.99,0:56:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这样总行了吧 - 行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That work for everybody? - Go do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.86,0:56:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么样 - 算你识相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How about that? - Oh, cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.49,0:56:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吧 - 这就对了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.63,0:56:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻不拉几的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone forget his nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.77,0:57:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗 帅哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.77,0:57:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好得很{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.51,0:57:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.45,0:57:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会是你的新搭档吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me he's your new partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.28,0:57:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我们是老搭档{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, he's my old partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.22,0:57:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从未来穿越回来拯救地球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He traveled back from the future to save the planet…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.05,0:57:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,停 别扯了 我不想知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, stop, don't tell me. I don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.35,0:57:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,安迪 洋子来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, Yoko's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.29,0:57:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,洋子来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yoko's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.29,0:57:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉她我正在拍吃汉堡的男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her that I'm filming this man eating a hamburger.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.16,0:57:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,效果太棒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's transcendent.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.70,0:57:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 现在换泡菜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, now the pickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.28,0:57:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想在我场子上干嘛 K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing on my turf, K?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.11,0:57:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,追捕一个杀手 来自伯格罗蒂特星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracking a killer. Boglodite.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.61,0:57:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为他下一个目标在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have reason to believe he's gonna hit here next,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.02,0:57:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个格莱美亚星人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a Glamourian.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.32,0:57:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,格莱美亚星人 你找对了星系 找错了星球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glamourian? Right solar system, wrong planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.55,0:57:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定是在找阿卡南人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gotta be after the Archanan.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.25,0:57:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿克南星人已经死光了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archanans are extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.69,0:57:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然没有 上周有一个被冲上了岸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently they are not. One washed ashore last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.83,0:58:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯威尔那边一直有他们的消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole Roswell circuit's all buzz about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.26,0:58:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一只外星独角兽 仅存的一只了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alien unicorn. Last of its species.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.20,0:58:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫格里芬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name's Griffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.70,0:58:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿卡南人格里芬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griffin the Archanan.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.50,0:58:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.74,0:58:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我好吗 这得看情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going? How's it going? That depends.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.46,0:58:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我个人来说 一切都很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me, personally, it's good, things are good.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.34,0:58:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 几秒钟以后就不好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless we're in the possible future.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.01,0:58:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个肌肉男跟他的女朋友吵架{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where the muscle boy argues with his girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.51,0:58:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怒气冲冲地离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She storms off and.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.83,0:58:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,撞到端着一盘填馅蘑菇的服务生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}bumps the guy with the stuffed mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.58,0:58:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把托盘扣到那个正要离开的水手身上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who dumps the tray on the sailors on leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.82,0:58:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,东西一个接一个被推倒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A shoving match breaks out.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.25,0:58:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后撞向这张桌子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They crash into the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.43,0:58:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我应该把碟子拿走 立刻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In which case, I gotta move my plate like right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.29,0:58:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 在我吃了这个熏肉三明治之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or it's the future where the pastrami sandwich I'm eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.26,0:58:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一阵胃疼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}causes me gastric distress.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.13,0:58:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好你朋友给了我他随身携带的胃药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thankfully, your friend offers the antacids he carries.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.93,0:58:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我很好 会很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in his right pocket, so good. I'll be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.94,0:58:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非 我两分半钟后就得离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except in the future where I have to leave in two and a half minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.04,0:58:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,等不到他把药给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just before he has a chance to offer me the antacids,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.64,0:58:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此整体来说 不好 我不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so on the whole, I'd have to say not good. I am not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.81,0:58:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还得看情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that depends.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.55,0:58:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.35,0:59:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么才能找到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will we find this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.75,0:59:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我又不是笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am l, a schmuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.99,0:59:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.82,0:59:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,「在这儿」是一种相对的说法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Here" is a relative term.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.40,0:59:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是第五维空间的高级生命体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a fifth dimensional being.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.03,0:59:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以以各种不确定的形态存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can live in and visualize an infinite set.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.50,0:59:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在不同的时空同时出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of time-space probabilities simultaneously.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.27,0:59:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有意思 干得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like fun. Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.97,0:59:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, K, K, K.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.90,0:59:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得把我弄「死」 退出卧底 懂不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta fake my death, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.37,0:59:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也受不了西塔琴的聒噪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't listen to sitar music anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.78,0:59:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我尽量 我会跟X说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'll see what I can do. I'll talk to X.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.51,0:59:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,K 我根本分不清他们是男是女{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K, I can't tell the women from the men.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.81,0:59:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看看你的表吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I see your watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.68,0:59:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是7：18{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it is 7:18.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.32,0:59:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这个 你爸爸给你的那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, your other watch, the one your father gave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.69,0:59:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道那个表的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know about my father's watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.43,0:59:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.10,0:59:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这说明罗曼已经死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the one where Roman is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.00,0:59:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,保龄球馆的那个人也死了 死了这么多人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the gentleman at the bowling alley. So much death.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.80,0:59:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功的几率无穷小啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such an infinitesimal small chance for success.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.11,0:59:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.34,0:59:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是格里芬吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griffin, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.01,0:59:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.84,0:59:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为孽畜鲍里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of Boris the animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.18,0:59:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为他要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correct. We think he's coming…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.51,1:00:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,来杀我 两分钟以内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To kill me. He'll be here in two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.31,1:00:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless we're in.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.45,1:00:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一路冲过来 没遇上一个红灯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the possible future where he made all the lights unbarring.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.08,1:00:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,提前到达此地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and got here early and is just about.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.25,1:00:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在门口就开火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to discharge weapon from the doorway.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.62,1:00:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样的话 我们两秒钟后就会死光光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in which case we're all dead in two seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.39,1:00:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 差一点儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, that was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.69,1:00:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,K 太空枪给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K, I need a space gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.56,1:00:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯格罗蒂特星人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Boglodites.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.53,1:00:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人毁星 无恶不作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}consume any planet in their path.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.10,1:00:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的星球 罗曼的 帕拉星人的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine, Roman's, the Parlaxians'.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.56,1:00:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试着阻止他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to stop them,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.54,1:00:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们这次成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if we stop them here,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.93,1:00:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们在地球上铩羽而归{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we deny them Earth…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.57,1:00:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,自绝而亡 我们就能一劳永逸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can stop them forever. They'll starve before.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.87,1:00:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止他们危害其它星球了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they reach the next planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.84,1:00:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还剩63秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sixty-three seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.44,1:00:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们该怎么办 如何阻止{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we do that? Stop them?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.48,1:00:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.65,1:00:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我有东西要给你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I have something for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.78,1:00:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个礼物 它会保护你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gift. It can protect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.65,1:00:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍里斯一直不知道它的存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to hide it from Boris,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.40,1:00:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过得等到下次见面的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you find me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.86,1:00:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再把它交给你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.86,1:00:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 比赛棒极了 厉害 真是奇迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. What a game! Amazing! It's a real miracle!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.76,1:00:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思 什么奇迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? What miracle?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.46,1:00:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,30秒 我得走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty seconds. I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.23,1:00:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 你走不了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.37,1:00:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们纠缠得越久 负面效应就越大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative possibilities are multiplying as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.94,1:00:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道了 - 20秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Twenty seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.40,1:00:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.24,1:00:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我们呢 别担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got it, relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.37,1:01:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你的表坏了 我又吃了熏肉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your watch is broken and I have gastric…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.67,1:01:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞吧 自由地飞翔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fly! Find your place in the world!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.61,1:01:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.48,1:01:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍里斯就要从那扇门进来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the one where Boris is coming through that door.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.58,1:01:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,12秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in 12,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.45,1:01:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,11 10{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}11, 10,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.28,1:01:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.19,1:01:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今早是不是喝了巧克力奶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you have chocolate milk this morning?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.02,1:01:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.79,1:01:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cindy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.39,1:01:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.33,1:01:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格里芬跑了 - 交给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Griffin! - Got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.40,1:01:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.92,1:01:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.53,1:01:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you got?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.66,1:01:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 让他跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it! We had him!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.16,1:01:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静 科奇斯 我们会找到他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, Cochise. We'll find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.83,1:02:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,声明一下 我的名字叫J 明白吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First of all, my name is J, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.67,1:02:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是什么 孩子 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not "Son, " It's not "Slick".
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.26,1:02:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,更加不是科奇斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it damn sure ain't no "Cochise."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.94,1:02:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么能冷静得下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.14,1:02:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了 又找不到别的线索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we're running out of time, we are runninng out of clues.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.84,1:02:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,入侵者就要来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's an invasion coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.58,1:02:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道没听出我声音里的紧张感吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not really recognizing my voicial intensity.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.18,1:02:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来有个人能帮我们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there was one guy who could help.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.45,1:02:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,格里芬 格里芬呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Griffin! Griffin! Where's Griffin?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.45,1:02:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,格里芬 格里芬哪儿去了 K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griffin. Where's Griffin at, K?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.52,1:02:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,消失了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.31,1:02:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果鲍里斯在我们之前找到他 就完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Boris gets to him before we do, that's no bueno.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.86,1:02:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要吃点东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need pie.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.39,1:02:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我爷爷总说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - My granddaddy always said,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.96,1:02:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你面临难题焦头烂额之时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"If you got a problem you can't solve,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.33,1:02:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃个派 可以帮你找到解决方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it helps to get out of your head." Pie.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.27,1:02:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 派 - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pie? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.20,1:02:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爷爷 很壮的那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your granddaddy, heavyset man?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.27,1:02:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有一点儿 - 是啊 你看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A little bit. - Yeah, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.74,1:02:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们一直都行事明智{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been doing smart stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.48,1:02:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺着蛛丝马迹 做好本职工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been following clues, doing real police work.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.88,1:02:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确也该干几件蠢事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might be time we do something stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.48,1:02:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,来做点毫无意义的废动作吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something that ain't got nothing to do with nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.22,1:02:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还真想吃几个派 K 我的确想吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I want some pie, K. I want some pie.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.29,1:02:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们就傻乎乎地吃派去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go get dumb-ass pie.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.29,1:02:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.82,1:03:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么特别推荐吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have any specials?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.52,1:03:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是只会点那几样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll have the same thing he always.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.67,1:03:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算他盯着菜单看个10分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}has after he reads the menu for 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.96,1:03:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算他问完两遍特别推荐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and asks about specials twice.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.56,1:03:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他一份苹果派 再加一份切达干酪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A slice of apple pie with a nasty piece of cheddar.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.39,1:03:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要一个草莓大黄派{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have the strawberry-rhubarb.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.10,1:03:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我最后一顿了 我得多吃点儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since it's my last meal, I'm gonna splurge a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.34,1:03:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,超级连环杀手逍遥法外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}World-class serial killer out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.40,1:03:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们却在这里吃派{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're having pie.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.97,1:03:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你平常都干些什么啊 紧张男{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you do in your spare time, stretch?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.54,1:03:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你没有深入理解吃派的真谛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I sense you're not embracing the concept here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.48,1:03:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,心诚派才会显灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pie don't work unless you let it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.68,1:03:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的心很诚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna let it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.25,1:03:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么不愿意开口聊呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you say we don't talk?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.29,1:04:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先来 问什么问题都行 随便问我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go ahead. Ask me any question. Anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.32,1:04:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要跟案件无关的都行 放马过来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as it doesn't have to do with the case. Just let her rip.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.06,1:04:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟O什么状态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up with you and O?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.36,1:04:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和O{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and O?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.20,1:04:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 你们俩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you and O.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.80,1:04:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,行啊 行啊你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.34,1:04:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.31,1:04:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,从前 我接到任务监视一个音乐家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A while back, I was assigned to keep tabs on a musician.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.88,1:04:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,米克·贾格尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mick Jagger?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.84,1:04:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一个英国乐队的主唱 滚石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in this British band, the Rolling Stones.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.31,1:04:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点儿印象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rings a bell.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.45,1:04:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为他来地球是为了繁衍后代{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We believed he was on the planet to breed with Earth women.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.95,1:04:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我去了伦敦 在那里遇到了O{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I was in London and that's when I met O.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.32,1:04:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很聪明 风趣 笑起来很美{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just smart. Funny. A great smile.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.39,1:04:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来我们就去了一个酒馆 就是个酒吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we find ourselves in this pub, which is a bar, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.70,1:04:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面的啤酒是温的 食物难吃到死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warm beer and the worst food you ever ate.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.10,1:04:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在那里玩飞镖 一直玩到天亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just played darts till the sun came up.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.80,1:04:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁也不想走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither of us wanted to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.91,1:05:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们到底发生了什么事 老兄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened to you, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.42,1:05:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 什么都还没发生呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. It hasn't happened yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.05,1:05:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, what about you, slick?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.80,1:05:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在未来有女朋友吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the future, you got yourself a girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.62,1:05:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.06,1:05:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信 没用的大都会棒球队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot believe this, freaking New York Mets.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.90,1:05:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群痿货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Total losers!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.43,1:05:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,做大都会的球迷真不容易啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a rough time to be a Mets fan.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.40,1:05:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 永远赶不上小熊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about it. Never gonna catch the Cubs.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.27,1:05:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来有趣 大都会其实在今年是赢家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's funny. The Mets actually win it all this year.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.54,1:05:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.14,1:05:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.07,1:05:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也觉得是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.94,1:05:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个月之后 坐那儿的那位仁兄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, three months from now, your buddies down there…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.68,1:05:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会叫他们为神奇大都会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}are gonna be calling them the Amazing Mets.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.01,1:05:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊异大都会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Miracle Mets.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.28,1:05:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.19,1:05:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么不对吗 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you got there, hoss?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.89,1:05:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个阿卡南人说 真神奇啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Archanan said, "It's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.83,1:05:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是奇迹 比赛时候见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a miracle! I'll see you at the game."
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.46,1:05:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他在哪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.66,1:05:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,早就说过要相信派嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you to trust the pie.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.97,1:05:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果格里芬要来看比赛的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Griffin's here for a game,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.93,1:06:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来的要么太早 要么太晚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's either too early or too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.67,1:06:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.57,1:06:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只需赶在鲍里斯之前找到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just gotta find him before Boris does.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.25,1:06:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,该把你的东西给你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to give you your things back,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.32,1:06:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,老搭档{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.69,1:06:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃了点儿派怎么还变粘糊了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get some pie in you, you get all mushy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.89,1:06:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不想再帮你拿东西了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just tired of carrying your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.33,1:06:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油啊 好样的 冲啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on now! All right! Let's go,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.80,1:06:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,大都会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mets!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.83,1:06:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊 大都会 冲啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, Mets! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.50,1:06:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大都会 冲啊 大都… - 格里芬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mets! Let's go, Met… - Griffin?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.44,1:06:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间刚刚好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just in time!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.07,1:06:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非罗宾森那一记{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless this is the one where.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.63,1:06:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,三垒球出现重大失误 大都会赢定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robinson bad-hops it past third, it's almost over.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.51,1:06:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们错过什么了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we missing something?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.71,1:06:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来看比赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.54,1:07:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是这样预知未来的 神了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is how you see things? This is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.95,1:07:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是站着说话不腰疼 不过还是有好处的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a gigantic pain in the ass. But it has its moments.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.15,1:07:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,比赛要等到十月份才开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This game doesn't happen till October.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.35,1:07:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,十月{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always October.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.96,1:07:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,十一月 还有明年三月{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and November and March.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.69,1:07:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么多未来发生的事 都是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So many futures, and all real.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.39,1:07:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不知道会碰上哪一些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know which will coalesce.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.86,1:07:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但时候一到 都会发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until then, they're all happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.83,1:07:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这个 我最爱的人类历史一瞬间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like this one, it's my favorite moment in human history.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.97,1:07:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的一切都聚合到一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the things that had to.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.18,1:07:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,推动大都会赢得世界职棒冠军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}converge for the Mets to win the World Series.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.50,1:07:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在之前的每一个赛季{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were in last place.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.62,1:07:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是垫底 结果他们赢得了比赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}every single season until they won it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.84,1:07:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你有个礼物要给我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you had a gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.31,1:07:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个在第五场里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That baseball.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.31,1:07:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后扔出的棒球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}thrown for the last out of game five,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.42,1:07:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是斯伯丁公司62年的产品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}manufactured in '62 by Spalding factory.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.38,1:07:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,产于马萨诸塞州奇科皮市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Chicopee, Massachusetts,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.48,1:07:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在飞行中存在缺陷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was aerodynamically flawed.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.02,1:07:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有块马皮在打磨时出了问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}due to the horsehide being improperly tanned.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.52,1:07:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为打磨师的老婆谢拉在那个周日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because Shella, the tanner's wife left him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.52,1:07:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟波多黎各的高尔夫球员跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a Puerto Rican golf pro that Sunday…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.19,1:07:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gift?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.86,1:08:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对对对 在盒子里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, of course. In the box.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.10,1:08:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个惊喜 帮你们保护地球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the surprise. To protect the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.10,1:08:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是保护网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a shield.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.71,1:08:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shield.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.91,1:08:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿卡南人 天网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archanan. Arc Net.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.27,1:08:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,就凭这个 你布置了天网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you did. You put up the Arc Net.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.61,1:08:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么布置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.34,1:08:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,球扔向戴维·约翰逊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When that ball is pitched to Davey Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.55,1:08:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他之所以打棒球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who became a baseball player.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.91,1:08:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为他爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because his dad couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.18,1:08:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,找不到一个足球给他当八岁生日的礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}find a football to give him for his 8 birthday,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.55,1:08:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,球打在球棒上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it hits.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.45,1:08:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就高了两微米{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}his bat two micrometers too high.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.59,1:08:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,迫使球飞向克里昂·琼斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}causing him to pop out to Cleon Jones.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.76,1:08:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他本来应该是个女孩克拉拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who would've been born Clara,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.17,1:08:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个统计打字员 如果不是他父母{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a statistical typist, if his parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.41,1:08:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天晚上上床前没有多喝那一杯酒的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}didn't have an extra glass of wine that night before going to bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.97,1:08:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A miracle.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.07,1:08:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来不可能 实际上总会发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is what seems impossible but happens anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.98,1:08:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去了我的家园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.65,1:08:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望这一幕在你们身上重演{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you to lose yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.22,1:08:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护地球需要奇迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll take a miracle,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.35,1:08:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你们能把它发射成功{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you pull this off.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.92,1:09:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一瞬间将成为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll be my new favorite moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.09,1:09:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类历史上我的新爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in human history.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.09,1:09:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.99,1:09:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忘记预测这一刻了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot to see this one coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.73,1:09:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.98,1:09:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来有这些吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have these in the future?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.31,1:09:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.65,1:09:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.42,1:09:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持罗盘零点位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep gyro settings at zero gain.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.59,1:09:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,将倾斜度和偏航值平衡围绕中心杆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balance pitch and yaw with bursts on the center stalk.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.32,1:09:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,设定力度在80到100单位之间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}between 80 and 100 psi.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.16,1:09:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的那些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.39,1:09:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一窍不通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}any of that!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.96,1:09:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗盘归零 - 没错啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gyro at zero gain. - lt is.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.20,1:09:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,倾斜度和偏航值平衡围绕中心杆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pitch and yaw with short bursts on the center stalk.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.77,1:09:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.60,1:09:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,设定力度在80到100单位之间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between 80 and 100 psi!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.60,1:09:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.27,1:09:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,把天网给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Arc Net! Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.31,1:09:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还不你得到它的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think this is the one where you get it!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.35,1:10:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还好吧 头儿 - 当然了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right there, chief? - Hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.61,1:10:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是有4个轮子就好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd be better with four wheels!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.32,1:10:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,最少也得是2个轱辘吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two is, like, my minimum.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.56,1:10:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果鲍里斯得到了天网会怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens if Boris gets the Arc Net?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.46,1:10:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯格罗蒂特入侵 地球会彻底毁灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boglodite invasion, total destruction of Earth!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.65,1:10:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我盒子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The box!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.57,1:10:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.23,1:10:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得阻止他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta stop this guy!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.00,1:10:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正想办法呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been trying!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.07,1:11:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你不是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't been trying?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.97,1:11:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, slick.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.98,1:11:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在未来咱们还跳德州两步舞吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the future, we ever do the Texas two-step?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.18,1:11:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.27,1:11:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,打中他了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get him?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.57,1:11:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我瞧瞧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a sec.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.45,1:11:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.78,1:11:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.05,1:11:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got away.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.72,1:11:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,救了格里芬就行 咱们走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got Griffin. Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.30,1:12:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨日重现啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel younger already.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.63,1:12:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,枉你身上还流着伯格罗蒂特人的血液{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pathetic waste of Boglodite flesh.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.20,1:12:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你若不是我自己 早就被我杀了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd kill you right now, if I didn't value my own life.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.77,1:12:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁 - 看看你自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.71,1:12:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所犯下的每一个错误{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every mistake I've ever made,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.41,1:12:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,都将在你身上出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just waiting to happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.94,1:12:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手臂怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to my arm?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.28,1:12:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,被一个人类打断了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lose it, shot off by a human.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.68,1:12:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有哪个人类能够战胜我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No human could defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.52,1:12:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来的40年 你都会像个动物一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You spend the next 40 years in prison,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.50,1:12:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,被关在监狱里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}chained up like an animal.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.95,1:12:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有哪个监狱能够关住我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No prison can hold me!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.99,1:12:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在月球上专门为我们造了一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They built one especially for us, on the moon.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.03,1:13:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类还没登上月球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No human has been to the moon,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.99,1:13:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,更不可能在那儿造监狱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they cannot have built it there already.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.83,1:13:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 听我的话就能避免这一切发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop arguing! You can avoid all of that if you just listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.00,1:13:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,被打败的是你 被打断胳膊的也是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were defeated! You let it get shot off!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.80,1:13:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我 是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't me, that was you!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.88,1:13:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.15,1:13:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止他们布置天网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prevent the Arc Net from being deployed.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.48,1:13:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀掉任何要这么做的人 - 好计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kill anyone who tries. - Good plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.52,1:13:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过没用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.65,1:13:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有在我的帮助下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With my help,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.85,1:13:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才能拿到天网 杀掉探员K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll get the Arc Net, kill Agent K,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.89,1:13:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,入侵地球才会成功{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The invasion will be successful,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.39,1:13:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能保住我们的胳…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll get to keep both of our ar…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.66,1:13:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再瞪着它看了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop… staring at it!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.07,1:13:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.52,1:13:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.28,1:14:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们救了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Thank you for saving my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.05,1:14:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,本职工作嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what we do.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.02,1:14:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,天网还在你手上吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still have the Arc Net?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.53,1:14:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你被孽畜鲍里斯追杀的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're being hunted by Boris the Animal,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.86,1:14:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏东西的能力也会突飞猛进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you get good at hiding things.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.95,1:14:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能够拯救你们的世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will save your world.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.96,1:14:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,它被发射到大气层外后会变大很多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once it's outside the atmosphere, it gets a whole lot bigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.80,1:14:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们只需要将它送上天就行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have to do is deploy it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.73,1:14:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,送到太空里 怎么做到呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean in space? Well, how do you suppose we do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.30,1:14:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要一小步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just one small step.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.49,1:15:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,登月计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The moon launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.99,1:15:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡纳维拉尔角{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cape Canaveral.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.00,1:15:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,1969年7月16日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}July 16th, 1969.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.20,1:15:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,6小时内我们得赶到佛罗里达州{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got six hours to get to Florida.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.72,1:15:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,该走了 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better get a move on, slick.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.53,1:15:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 别慌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, hold up.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.97,1:15:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 这次我得一个人去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not us. I'm gonna do this one alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.27,1:15:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他得亲自去…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has to be the one…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.34,1:15:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,格里芬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Griffin.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.37,1:15:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫一个人去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, alone?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.28,1:15:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去佛罗里达 你待在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go to Florida. You gotta stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.98,1:15:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次你得相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to trust me on this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.01,1:15:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信你 没门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust you? I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.56,1:15:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么瞒着我的就直说吧 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something you're not telling me, slick?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.88,1:15:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正不准去佛罗里达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you that you're not going to Florida.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.52,1:15:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 搭档{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ain't gonna happen, partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.45,1:15:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,K 抱歉 这次我真不能让你去佛罗里达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, K, please, I will not allow you to go to Florida.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.79,1:15:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,说服我吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.70,1:15:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会死在那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You die there!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.87,1:16:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡纳维拉尔角 阿波罗计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cape Canaveral. Apollo launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.88,1:16:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那里被鲍里斯杀死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boris kills you there.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.15,1:16:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是我穿越的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm here for.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.32,1:16:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来就是为了阻止这一切的发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I came back to stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.02,1:16:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 原来我是在这个时空里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear. We're in this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.32,1:16:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,K 我找过所有的文件档案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K, I saw the file, I looked at the report.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.33,1:16:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过我不会瞒着你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I told you everything…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.16,1:16:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一拳是为你瞒着我而打的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's for lying to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.93,1:16:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sorry, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.07,1:16:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一拳则是因为告诉我真相打的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's for telling me the truth!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.07,1:16:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想保护你 伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to protect you, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.68,1:16:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,最苦涩的真话也比最甜蜜的谎言要好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bitterest truth is better than the sweetest lies.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.08,1:16:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他得和你一起去卡纳维拉尔角{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has to go to Cape Canaveral.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.09,1:16:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,布置天网的只能是他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must deploy the Arc Net as he did before.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.02,1:16:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没别的办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no other way.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.09,1:16:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,K是拯救地球唯一的希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K is the only hope in saving Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.09,1:16:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我能救他吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I save him?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.53,1:17:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到底有没有救他的机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any future where I save his life?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.77,1:17:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.11,1:17:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但注定的死亡总会在注定的时空中发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But where there is death, there will always be death.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.56,1:17:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说来 我已经这么干过一次了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to you, I've done this before.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.98,1:17:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以布置天网是可行的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we know it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.13,1:17:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要有平时吹嘘的一半本事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're half the agent you say you are,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.56,1:17:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就在我行动的时候保护我别被杀掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll make sure I don't get killed doing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.98,1:17:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱俩真的是好搭档吗 证明一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are we partners? You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.81,1:17:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.50,1:18:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,K探员 你还好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent K, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.60,1:18:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.16,1:18:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么话一边办正事一边说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, group hug on the way to doing what we're doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.50,1:18:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早上 人类将{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This morning, man is about to.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.11,1:18:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行探月计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}launch himself on a trip to the moon.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.91,1:18:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,并尝试登陆月球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the expectation of landing there.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.54,1:18:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I gotta ask you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.18,1:18:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,等解决了这个问题 结案之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we pull this off, fix things the way they were.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.75,1:18:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和O会不会…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}O and I, are we…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.68,1:18:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个智者曾告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A wise man once told me,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.05,1:18:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要问那些你不想面对的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't ask questions you don't want to know the answer to.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.19,1:18:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是我说的吧 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I said that, didn't I? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.53,1:18:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.86,1:18:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么 - 火箭飞行器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are they? - Jetpacks.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.17,1:18:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,火箭飞行器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jetpacks?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.80,1:18:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 我们不坐飞行器过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. We're not doing jetpacks.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.70,1:18:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意在未来被淘汰是有原因的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a reason we don't have these in the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.21,1:18:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,K 咱们开车过去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K, we gotta drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.64,1:18:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,5个小时不够从曼哈顿开车去佛罗里达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't drive to Florida from Manhattan in five hours, chief.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.88,1:18:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,够 用超黑警车上标配的红钮就行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we can. The red button, standard issue in every MIB car.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.98,1:18:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,按下红钮 就能进入极速模式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Press the red button, goes into hyperdrive.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.02,1:19:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那玩意儿还没发明出来呢 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No red buttons yet, slick.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.55,1:19:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是要命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.76,1:19:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道这破玩意儿怎么使吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how to work this stupid thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.23,1:19:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么特别之处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like with anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.53,1:19:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,扣好皮带 剩下的就听天由命了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just have to strap yourself in, hope for the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.57,1:19:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗 O小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that right, Miss O?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.24,1:19:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 就是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.42,1:19:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready, slick?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.59,1:19:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,去搞定它吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.36,1:19:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定会十分有趣的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna be interesting!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.11,1:19:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离阿波罗11号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just minutes to the.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.61,1:19:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,史诗般的发射只有几分钟时间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}historic launch of Apollo 11.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.41,1:20:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,到目前为止一切顺利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with all going well.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.13,1:20:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,真庆幸没有进入半路爆炸的时空{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so glad this isn't one of the times we explode.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.57,1:20:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸的时空{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the times?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.10,1:20:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we got company.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.18,1:20:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这什么玩意儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.25,1:20:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,腰带式蓄电池{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a battery belt?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.09,1:20:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是我来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.83,1:20:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 每一个成功布置护罩的时空里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, any reality that gets the shield deployed is one.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.60,1:20:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都得实话实说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you tell the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.70,1:20:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,实话实说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.44,1:21:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,照实说是唯一的方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth is the only path.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.64,1:21:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是禁区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a restricted area!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.35,1:21:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir, it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.48,1:21:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好 先生们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.77,1:21:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天对美国来说真是意义重大的一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great day for America, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.62,1:21:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是探员J 这位是探员K 那位是格里夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Agent J. This is Agent K. That's Griff.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.45,1:21:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们隶属于一个机密政府组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're from a secret government organization.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.72,1:21:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,其主要负责管理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that polices and monitors.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.21,1:21:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,外星人在地球内外的各种活动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}alien activity on and off planet Earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.70,1:21:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情是这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.00,1:21:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把这个格里夫给我们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have this special little metal thingy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.63,1:21:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别的小铁块{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Griff gave us.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.85,1:21:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,放在火箭的顶部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we have to get on top of that rocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.60,1:21:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,来阻止外星人入侵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to prevent an alien invasion.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.64,1:21:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,会相信才怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That worked.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.74,1:21:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等着瞧 - 长官 四号门有情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like a charm. - Sir, Delta Gate. We have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.81,1:21:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住三个身份不明携有武器的入侵者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three trespassers. No lDs, but they've got weapons, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.38,1:21:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些武器我可从未见过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind I've never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.33,1:21:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们敢在人类史上最重要的一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What breed of fool do you have to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.03,1:22:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑到我的地盘上来撒野{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to penetrate my site on the day of the most massive feat.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.13,1:22:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是吃了熊心豹子胆了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}attempted by mankind?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.53,1:22:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,在上帝 世界人民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watched by God, the population of the planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.78,1:22:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我儿子的注视之下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my own firstborn!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.64,1:22:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.67,1:22:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校 这是他们身上找到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel, they had these.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.94,1:22:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说要把某物放在火箭上防止外敌入侵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said they needed to put something on the rocket for an invasion.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.68,1:22:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.88,1:22:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有10分钟就要发射了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got 10 minutes to launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.39,1:22:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要是知道什么有关火箭的隐情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you pose a threat to that rocket,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.61,1:22:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,请立马照实告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you tell me now and do not lie to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.86,1:22:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次我是照实说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told the truth last time.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.87,1:22:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 这个人从未来回来保护我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, this man came here from the future to protect me,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.40,1:22:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我才能将一个护罩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I can attach a shield.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.68,1:22:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,附在火箭顶端以拯救世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the top of that rocket and save the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.97,1:22:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要您的帮助来完成这件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help to do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.11,1:22:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们关进监狱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take them to the brig.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.58,1:22:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没用啊 格里夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're slipping, Griff.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.62,1:22:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 请允许我让您看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, if I may.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.07,1:23:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,下士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corporal.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.14,1:23:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你的人可以走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You men are no longer needed.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.97,1:23:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲自押送这些犯人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take the prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.47,1:23:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官 您… - 解散{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir, are you… - Dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.15,1:23:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.49,1:23:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你展示未来 给他看了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did the future thing. What did you show him?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.86,1:23:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要看的部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only what he needed to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.33,1:23:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go now.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.83,1:23:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不 一起来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No, no, no. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.67,1:23:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来就没我的事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.60,1:23:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,格里夫 我可没工夫和你扯淡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Griff, don't start flipping on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.14,1:23:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,当鲍里斯的胳膊被打断后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Boris' arm is taken,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.41,1:23:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切就会回归原样 K也会活下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the past will be as it was. K will survive.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.78,1:23:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会记得你曾回来帮过他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will not know you were ever here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.45,1:23:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,打断胳膊 布置天网 就像系统还原一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Arm gone, got it. Like a reset?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.68,1:24:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定以后回到你的时空就行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When that happens, go home. Leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.12,1:24:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 该走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey slick, you coming?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.96,1:24:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, all right!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.89,1:24:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 伙计 咱们还会见面吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, man. Hey, will I ever see you again?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.63,1:24:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切皆有可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything's possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.03,1:24:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,格里夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Griff.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.71,1:24:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每次都不忍直视这一部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can never bear to watch this part.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.15,1:24:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿姆斯特朗和奥尔德林拟定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Armstrong and Aldrin are scheduled.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.98,1:24:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,于东部夏令时的周一清晨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to set foot on the moon.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.05,1:24:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,踏上月球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on early Monday morning, Eastern Daylight Time.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.39,1:24:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,格里芬哪儿去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Griffin?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.36,1:24:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,忙自己的事去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing his own thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.75,1:25:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.55,1:25:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,电梯能载你们到楼顶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This elevator will take you to the top.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.95,1:25:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,要将天网发射到大气层外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get the Arc Net outside the atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.12,1:25:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得把它绑在航天舱前面的分离火箭上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you need to strap it to the escape rocket above the capsule!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.33,1:25:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,切记要在火箭发射前离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not want to be anywhere near this rocket when it takes off!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.26,1:25:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有问题吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Questions?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.01,1:25:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了 谢谢 上校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Thank you for this, colonel.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.83,1:25:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的工作很伟大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some job you got there.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.63,1:25:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 哥们儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, thanks a lot, bro.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.97,1:25:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,格里夫刚才给你看了些什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did Griff show you back there?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.64,1:25:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让我知道了你们有多重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He show me how important you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.41,1:25:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你搭档{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.25,1:25:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是一切顺利的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey look, if everything goes right the way we hope it does.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.85,1:25:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能我最后得不辞而别{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna end up getting out of here pretty quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.76,1:25:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我就没机会给你说再见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I'm not gonna have a chance to say a proper goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.36,1:25:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是不顺利的话你同样没机会说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If things go wrong, not gonna have a chance to, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.83,1:25:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,死活都是一拼 豁出去算了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I guess win or lose, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.00,1:26:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道为什么招募你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see why I recruited you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.78,1:26:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这人不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good man.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.38,1:26:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good man.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.45,1:26:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你这是怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, what the hell happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.12,1:26:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没到说这些的时候呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, it still hasn't happened yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.29,1:26:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来对付这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take this one!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.40,1:26:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,臭小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naughty.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.20,1:26:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你真该抽空去做做美甲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, get a pedicure if you get a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.18,1:26:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也该学学飞行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And liftoff.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.76,1:27:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在进入两分钟倒计时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just passed the two-minute mark in the countdown,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.01,1:27:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有数据监控正常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all is still go as we monitor our status board.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.42,1:27:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇航员报告情况正常 能源传送完毕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Astronauts report it feels good. Power transfer is complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.99,1:27:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼尔·阿姆斯特朗回报 倒计时顺利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neil Armstrong just reported back it's been a smooth countdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.80,1:28:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍里斯 来帮我一把啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boris, can you give me a hand?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.81,1:28:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见我喊你了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me calling you?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.31,1:28:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,孽畜鲍里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boris the Animal!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.15,1:28:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,孽畜鲍里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boris the Animal!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.22,1:28:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我鲍里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just Boris!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.43,1:28:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你输定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.76,1:28:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不这样认为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's agree to disagree.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.85,1:29:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,孽畜鲍里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boris the Animal!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.46,1:29:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,右{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.10,1:29:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,左{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.83,1:29:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你输定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.90,1:29:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不这样认为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's agree to disagree.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.91,1:29:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,孽畜鲍里斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boris the Animal!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.65,1:30:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,右{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.72,1:30:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,左 左{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left. Left.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.35,1:30:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,右{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.19,1:30:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.43,1:30:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不这样认为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's agree to disagree.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.07,1:30:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not possible!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.05,1:30:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}K!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.72,1:30:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了 我比未来的自己要强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I win! I'm better than me!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.46,1:30:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不愧是我的搭档{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.24,1:31:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在报告总部的话他们肯定会取消发射的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we call this in, they'll scrub the launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.20,1:31:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我啥也没看见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.81,1:31:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你搭档呢 - 回他的时空了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's your partner? - He went home.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.84,1:31:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回去的 - 我也不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How does that work? - You got me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.51,1:31:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.66,1:31:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,卧倒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.53,1:32:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.80,1:32:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 这可真是高科技{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, that is some next-level stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.87,1:32:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,想了解更多的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever want to see more,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.41,1:32:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道有个机密组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a top-secret organization.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.53,1:32:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿意招募你这样的人员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that could use a man like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.65,1:32:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意之至{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.88,1:32:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.48,1:32:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们未来见 K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you around, K.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.09,1:32:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.06,1:33:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.00,1:33:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮捕我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrest me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.33,1:33:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次不会了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.01,1:33:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,注定的死亡总会在注定的时空中发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Where there's death, there will always be death."
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.36,1:33:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy! Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.53,1:33:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫K 你叫什么名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, my name's K. What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.04,1:33:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}James.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.24,1:33:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 好名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}James? That's a nice name.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.97,1:33:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.21,1:33:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手里拿的是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you got there? What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.25,1:33:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸给我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.78,1:33:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在给火箭倒计时呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We timed the launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.16,1:34:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸哪儿去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is my daddy?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.06,1:34:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.06,1:34:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有一些特别的事要忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went to go do something very special.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.97,1:34:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他嘱咐我待在这照顾他最好的哥们儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he wanted me to stay here and take care of his best pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.25,1:34:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他多久回来呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When is he gonna be back?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.58,1:34:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.77,1:34:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}James…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.60,1:34:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you look right here,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.54,1:34:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你你唯一需要记住的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will tell you the only thing you ever need to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.28,1:35:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸是个英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your daddy is a hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.28,1:35:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸是个英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daddy is a hero?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.95,1:35:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想去散散步吗 - 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Want to take a walk with me? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.80,1:35:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}James?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.02,1:35:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个由梦筑成的钢筋混凝土的城市里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Concrete jungle where dreams are made of.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.97,1:35:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以随心所欲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theres nothing you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.89,1:35:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你现在身处纽约{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're in New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.03,1:35:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,街道会让你感觉焕然一新{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These streets will make you feel brand new.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.16,1:35:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,灯光将启迪你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lights will inspire you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.12,1:36:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是纽约 纽约 纽约{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lets here it for New York, New York, New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.48,1:36:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你迟到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're late.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.28,1:36:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 搞错时间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Lost track of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.52,1:36:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会唱这首歌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that song?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.08,1:36:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝你的咖啡吧 我们还有活要干呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink your coffee. We got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.02,1:36:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在到底知道什么 不知道什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know and what do you don't?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.99,1:36:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道自己不知道什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I know what I don't know?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.86,1:36:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,问得好 昨晚咱俩是不是去吴园酒家吃饭了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a really good question. Did we go to Wu's last night?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.93,1:36:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.03,1:36:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯格罗蒂特人呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boglodites?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.06,1:36:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝迹40年了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extinct for 40 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.26,1:36:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 昨晚咱俩通电话了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect. Did we talk on the phone last night?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.70,1:36:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你挂了我电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hung up on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.37,1:36:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我挂的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.04,1:36:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为宇宙还有未知的秘密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that was because of all those secrets the universe doesn't know about.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.38,1:36:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过昨晚确实是漫长的一夜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've realized that last night was a long long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.73,1:36:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我还是想说谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, really, I just want to say thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.06,1:37:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的义务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been my privilege.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.91,1:37:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实现在很有可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, there's a really high possibility now.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.48,1:37:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道一些你不知道的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I might know some things you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.25,1:37:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.98,1:37:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了你和O之间发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet I know what went down with you and O.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.12,1:37:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个贤惠的女人 不过你懂规矩的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a fine lady, but you know the rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.71,1:37:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员之间不能调情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no fraternizing amongst agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.56,1:37:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你还是和她调过一两次情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think y'all might have fraternized a time or two.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.43,1:37:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是人类历史上我的新爱时刻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my new favorite moment in human history.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.93,1:37:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非在这个时空里K忘了给小费{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless this is the one where K forgot to leave a tip.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.78,1:37:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点忘了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.19,1:38:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.27,0:31:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 祝你好运 J - 这个星球没救了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good luck, J! - This planet's toast.
